00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:33,120
I think that every consumer app is about to have AI, you know, whether it's a fitness app, whether it's a learning app, a finance app, a screen time app too.

220
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:41,840
But I think the question that maybe people need to ask is, you know, how do you actually build an AI that's on your user's side?

221
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:49,440
And what I mean by that is, how do we actually build an AI that actually helps deliver more value to users?

222
00:21:50,320 --> 00:21:56,000
And I think that today, there's not enough people doing that.

223
00:21:57,040 --> 00:22:05,760
And so, you know, it's not so much about, I think, using AI to, you know, maybe trick users into doing something.

224
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:16,320
I think it really has to come from, okay, what is the exact core value of like why people are using my app and how can I make that a lot better using, using AI?

