00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:50,240
We can kind of get caught up with all that it can do and add some fancy features to the app.

233
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:54,640
But, and you're gonna get, you know, if you do that, you're probably gonna get a lot of early adopters.

