00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:43,040
And I think that in the case, in our case, of course, that's part of the value.

279
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:52,960
And I think it's also aligned with the fact that we do need the next generation to learn to build these skills, to build healthier habits than the previous generations.

280
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,800
And so it works, it works together.

281
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:55,840
That's awesome.

