00:31:54,320 --> 00:32:15,680
But, you know, for us, really, the journey has been the initial product market fit was on professionals that are increasing their products, is still a big part of what's of our customer base and then we expanded to a new segment with students as we opened up freemium and then we have this kind of new segment as well going into the education world.

