00:32:31,840 --> 00:32:47,680
But, you know, you also see other segments that are possible that are, you know, more kind of health and lifestyle segments, similar to what URA, I think, and WOOP have done in the health metrics measurements, but, you know, screen time is also a big, big part of people's health.

